District Ranger Holman, Elizabeth, Christina,</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0=
, 0, 0);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0=
, 0, 0);">
I want to share something with you that came into focus for me today =97 wa=
lking to the ocean on a sunny afternoon, processing everything that's happe=
ned this past week.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0=
, 0, 0);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0=
, 0, 0);">
I've spent a year documenting what Oregon State Parks did to me. Today I fi=
nally named the mechanism underneath all of it. I'm calling it displacement=
. It is the institutional tactic of removing an inconvenient person from th=
e ground they stand on =97 not through
 legitimate process, but through escalating pressure designed to make stayi=
ng feel impossible. I documented nine stages of it at Honeyman. It is now o=
n the archive.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0=
, 0, 0);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0=
, 0, 0);">
What I want you to know is this: you have not run that scheme on me. Not on=
ce in a year. What happened on March 24th was brought to this place from ou=
tside it. I know the difference. I have lived both sides of it now.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0=
, 0, 0);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0=
, 0, 0);">
I built a life here. I love this corridor. I love this work. I love the dun=
es and the ocean and the trails I've walked hundreds of times. I love the p=
eople I've met here =97 including both of you. That is not nothing. After w=
hat came before, that is everything.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0=
, 0, 0);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0=
, 0, 0);">
I don't want to be displaced again. I am asking you to help make sure I'm n=
ot.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0=
, 0, 0);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0=
, 0, 0);">
I understand the situation is complicated by what Oliver did. I am not aski=
ng you to pretend it isn't. I am asking you to see me clearly =97 as the pe=
rson who has shown up every day for a year, who has done this work with int=
egrity, and who is still here asking
 to stay.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0=
, 0, 0);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0=
, 0, 0);">
If the Olympic Peninsula transfer comes through, I will go with gratitude a=
nd without bitterness. But if there is a way to keep me here =97 or somewhe=
re close =97 I want you to know that I want that too.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0=
